  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "一位97岁的老人，依然在坚守这家一百多岁的旧书店，这是我见过最孤独的书店，我想把他的故事告诉所有爱书人，文学山房旧书店，江澄波老爷爷#读书 #旧书店 #阅读 #温情 #治愈",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 179.7,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你能想象吗？一位九十七岁的老人，依然在坚守着一家一百多年历史的旧书店。这是我见过的全中国最孤独的一家书店。我想把他的故事告诉给每一个爱书的人。在苏州的柳家巷，一棵高大的玉兰树下，有一个不起眼的小门脸，文学山房旧书店，他卖书只卖旧书。这个规矩从一百三十多年前就定下了书店，不大，一进去就能闻到书籍的油墨。香爱书人闻到这种这种味道，顿顿时静静来来，里面没有空调，只有老式的电风扇在吱呀作响。坐在角落的就是店主江成波老爷爷，他今年已经九十七岁了，他是从他的爷爷那里继承了这家创立于清朝光绪年间的旧书店，江成波老人家，也是我国著名的古籍版本学家。他从小跟随祖父学习十几岁，就能熟练的背诵四库全书的版本目录。他已经和古籍打了一辈子的教导。每一套收来的古籍都经他的手整理修补，编好序号，再放上书架。他的记忆力特别强，说话逻辑性很清晰。顾客只要一报出书名，他就能说出作者成熟年月、看课时间和大致内容。老人家曾经也为抢救古籍做过很多贡献。国家图书馆南京图书馆南京博物院里面有很多江成波捐献的珍贵的宋代国籍。姜爷爷很投入的向我描述说，曾经有很多大师级的学者都来文学山房买过书。他小时候就见过章太炎、叶圣陶、郑正铎这些名家来店里的卖书，这个书店呢一点也不网红，就这样本本分分安安静静，让人看了有一种踏踏实实的感觉。进店的读者来到这里，不会打卡拍照都只是安安静静的读书。九十七岁的江爷爷由于白内障视力不太好，但他还是坚持着给我的短视频提了字。他的落款是九七老人江成波，而我看望他的这一天，正好是二零二二年九月七号。姜老说，这是很神奇的缘分。他说，书店就像一个城市的眉毛，眉毛长在脸上，也许并不是最要紧的五官，但若少了这两道眉毛，再天生丽质的脸蛋就会显得美中不足。我十六岁就到书店，十六岁也在九十七岁，您今年九十七岁，但是八十年八十年啊，八十岁，准备要进零点三，真的，你九十七岁这么这么好。对呀，我是太太妹妹，九十七岁了不稀岁的，他这个有误之极，学无止境啊。哎，学弟呀，我我也在也是，我也在也在学，嗯嗯，现在说站着也有，对不对？如果你下次来苏州，请记得看一看文学山房旧书店，看一看江成伯老爷爷嗯。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1010,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1230,
      "end_ms": 2790,
      "text": "一位九十七岁的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2850,
      "end_ms": 5970,
      "text": "依然在坚守着一家一百多年历史的旧书店。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6330,
      "end_ms": 8950,
      "text": "这是我见过的全中国最孤独的一家书店。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9350,
      "end_ms": 12010,
      "text": "我想把他的故事告诉给每一个爱书的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12610,
      "end_ms": 13990,
      "text": "在苏州的柳家巷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14130,
      "end_ms": 15710,
      "text": "一棵高大的玉兰树下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15850,
      "end_ms": 17390,
      "text": "有一个不起眼的小门脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17790,
      "end_ms": 19610,
      "text": "文学山房旧书店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20110,
      "end_ms": 21890,
      "text": "他卖书只卖旧书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22190,
      "end_ms": 25610,
      "text": "这个规矩从一百三十多年前就定下了书店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00012",
      "start_ms": 25610,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "不大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26170,
      "end_ms": 28350,
      "text": "一进去就能闻到书籍的油墨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28350,
      "end_ms": 30540,
      "text": "香爱书人闻到这种这种味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30540,
      "end_ms": 32260,
      "text": "顿顿时静静来来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00016",
      "start_ms": 32260,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "里面没有空调，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33500,
      "end_ms": 35920,
      "text": "只有老式的电风扇在吱呀作响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36220,
      "end_ms": 39340,
      "text": "坐在角落的就是店主江成波老爷爷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39620,
      "end_ms": 41440,
      "text": "他今年已经九十七岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41740,
      "end_ms": 46600,
      "text": "他是从他的爷爷那里继承了这家创立于清朝光绪年间的旧书店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00021",
      "start_ms": 47080,
      "end_ms": 48040,
      "text": "江成波老人家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00022",
      "start_ms": 48040,
      "end_ms": 50380,
      "text": "也是我国著名的古籍版本学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00023",
      "start_ms": 51240,
      "end_ms": 53740,
      "text": "他从小跟随祖父学习十几岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00024",
      "start_ms": 53740,
      "end_ms": 56640,
      "text": "就能熟练的背诵四库全书的版本目录。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00025",
      "start_ms": 56640,
      "end_ms": 59040,
      "text": "他已经和古籍打了一辈子的教导。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00026",
      "start_ms": 59040,
      "end_ms": 62950,
      "text": "每一套收来的古籍都经他的手整理修补，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00027",
      "start_ms": 62990,
      "end_ms": 63850,
      "text": "编好序号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00028",
      "start_ms": 64070,
      "end_ms": 65115,
      "text": "再放上书架。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00029",
      "start_ms": 65540,
      "end_ms": 66760,
      "text": "他的记忆力特别强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00030",
      "start_ms": 66760,
      "end_ms": 68465,
      "text": "说话逻辑性很清晰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00031",
      "start_ms": 68780,
      "end_ms": 70340,
      "text": "顾客只要一报出书名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70460,
      "end_ms": 74865,
      "text": "他就能说出作者成熟年月、看课时间和大致内容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00033",
      "start_ms": 75400,
      "end_ms": 78435,
      "text": "老人家曾经也为抢救古籍做过很多贡献。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00034",
      "start_ms": 78880,
      "end_ms": 85165,
      "text": "国家图书馆南京图书馆南京博物院里面有很多江成波捐献的珍贵的宋代国籍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00035",
      "start_ms": 85760,
      "end_ms": 87760,
      "text": "姜爷爷很投入的向我描述说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00036",
      "start_ms": 87780,
      "end_ms": 91465,
      "text": "曾经有很多大师级的学者都来文学山房买过书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00037",
      "start_ms": 92140,
      "end_ms": 97165,
      "text": "他小时候就见过章太炎、叶圣陶、郑正铎这些名家来店里的卖书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00038",
      "start_ms": 97630,
      "end_ms": 99470,
      "text": "这个书店呢一点也不网红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00039",
      "start_ms": 99590,
      "end_ms": 102365,
      "text": "就这样本本分分安安静静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102790,
      "end_ms": 105320,
      "text": "让人看了有一种踏踏实实的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00041",
      "start_ms": 105560,
      "end_ms": 106920,
      "text": "进店的读者来到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00042",
      "start_ms": 106920,
      "end_ms": 110475,
      "text": "不会打卡拍照都只是安安静静的读书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00043",
      "start_ms": 111190,
      "end_ms": 114090,
      "text": "九十七岁的江爷爷由于白内障视力不太好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00044",
      "start_ms": 114230,
      "end_ms": 116870,
      "text": "但他还是坚持着给我的短视频提了字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00045",
      "start_ms": 117110,
      "end_ms": 120525,
      "text": "他的落款是九七老人江成波，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00046",
      "start_ms": 121420,
      "end_ms": 122680,
      "text": "而我看望他的这一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00047",
      "start_ms": 122680,
      "end_ms": 124985,
      "text": "正好是二零二二年九月七号。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00048",
      "start_ms": 125530,
      "end_ms": 126070,
      "text": "姜老说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00049",
      "start_ms": 126070,
      "end_ms": 127435,
      "text": "这是很神奇的缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00050",
      "start_ms": 128350,
      "end_ms": 128730,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00051",
      "start_ms": 128770,
      "end_ms": 130630,
      "text": "书店就像一个城市的眉毛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00052",
      "start_ms": 130790,
      "end_ms": 132010,
      "text": "眉毛长在脸上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00053",
      "start_ms": 132090,
      "end_ms": 133970,
      "text": "也许并不是最要紧的五官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00054",
      "start_ms": 134170,
      "end_ms": 135805,
      "text": "但若少了这两道眉毛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00055",
      "start_ms": 136160,
      "end_ms": 139145,
      "text": "再天生丽质的脸蛋就会显得美中不足。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00056",
      "start_ms": 139760,
      "end_ms": 141280,
      "text": "我十六岁就到书店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141500,
      "end_ms": 143140,
      "text": "十六岁也在九十七岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143380,
      "end_ms": 144400,
      "text": "您今年九十七岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00059",
      "start_ms": 144400,
      "end_ms": 146060,
      "text": "但是八十年八十年啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00060",
      "start_ms": 146060,
      "end_ms": 146825,
      "text": "八十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00061",
      "start_ms": 147110,
      "end_ms": 148705,
      "text": "准备要进零点三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00062",
      "start_ms": 149240,
      "end_ms": 149665,
      "text": "真的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00063",
      "start_ms": 149900,
      "end_ms": 151740,
      "text": "你九十七岁这么这么好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00064",
      "start_ms": 152000,
      "end_ms": 152360,
      "text": "对呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00065",
      "start_ms": 152360,
      "end_ms": 153480,
      "text": "我是太太妹妹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00066",
      "start_ms": 153480,
      "end_ms": 154980,
      "text": "九十七岁了不稀岁的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00067",
      "start_ms": 156120,
      "end_ms": 157325,
      "text": "他这个有误之极，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00068",
      "start_ms": 157670,
      "end_ms": 158610,
      "text": "学无止境啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00069",
      "start_ms": 158610,
      "end_ms": 159005,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00070",
      "start_ms": 159790,
      "end_ms": 160390,
      "text": "学弟呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00071",
      "start_ms": 160390,
      "end_ms": 161850,
      "text": "我我也在也是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00072",
      "start_ms": 161930,
      "end_ms": 163025,
      "text": "我也在也在学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00073",
      "start_ms": 163460,
      "end_ms": 163850,
      "text": "嗯嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00074",
      "start_ms": 164190,
      "end_ms": 165545,
      "text": "现在说站着也有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00075",
      "start_ms": 166270,
      "end_ms": 166815,
      "text": "对不对？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00076",
      "start_ms": 167310,
      "end_ms": 168530,
      "text": "如果你下次来苏州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00077",
      "start_ms": 168670,
      "end_ms": 171130,
      "text": "请记得看一看文学山房旧书店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_30cc827b5d5dd936_s00078",
      "start_ms": 171330,
      "end_ms": 176760,
      "text": "看一看江成伯老爷爷嗯。"
    }
  ],
